  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U4 Anti-corruption tailored workshop in Albania - Anti-corruption event - Integrity week</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">U4 Anti-corruption tailored workshop in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over the past decade and more, significant investments have been made in tackling corruption in Albania. The objective of the intervention was to support the organizing of a tailored anti-corruption workshop from U4 in Albania. The Embassy of Sweden in Albania partnered with the Embassy of Switzerland in hosting the event. The topic of the workshop was &quot;Anti-corruption in Albania: what can be done in sectors&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r en skr&#xe4;ddarsydd workshop p&#xe5; temat antikorruption anordnad av U4 i Albanien. Den svenska ambassaden och den schweiziska ambassaden i Tirana kommer tillsammans att vara v&#xe4;rdar f&#xf6;r evenemanget. Det f&#xf6;reslagna huvud&#xe4;mnet f&#xf6;r workshopen &#xe4;r utformning av insatser vid systematisk korruption med fokus p&#xe5; reformering av den offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution supports the organizing of a tailored anti-corruption workshop from U4 in Albania. The Embassy of Sweden in Albania  is partnering the Embassy of Switzerland in hosting the event. The main topic proposed is in designing interventions in the contexts of systemic corruption with focus on public administration reform.</narrative>
  </description>
